  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "About this space<br><br>Sleeps 26!<br><br>BRAND NEW & STUNNING! LOADED with amenities! Located just steps from the beach in Seagrove! <br><br>HUGE resort-stlye private pool & hot tub, expansive panoramic Gulf views from the 4th floor rooftop deck and throughout, complimentary 6-seater LSV/golf cart & 6 bikes, built-in outdoor kitchen, PUTTING GREEN, pool table, theater room, bunk room, fire pit, 4+ indoor and outdoor living spaces, porches, 6 bedrooms all with en-suite bathrooms - this home has it all for the PERFECT beach vacay!<br><br>The space<br><br>Welcome to 'Pine & Palm!'<br><br>It is an easy 2-minute walk to the Santa Clara beach access at the end of the street which is equipped with parking, restrooms, lifeguards during season, and a ramped walkway down to the beach (don't have to use stairs)!<br><br>HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>-Beach access is directly at the end of the street<br>-6-passenger LSV/golf cart included complimentary<br>-6 bikes provided<br>-Fully equipped with 2 dishwashers, 2 refrigerators, 2 washer + dryers, and double ovens<br>-Stand-alone ice maker in the kitchen<br>-Large zero-entry lagoon-style pool<br>-Putting green beside pool!<br>-Large built-in gas fire pit with space to easily accommodate 8+<br>-Hot tub, which can be heated separately from the pool<br>-Rec/game room on 2nd floor with bar, beverage fridge, pool table, game/poker table and shuffle board table! This room opens up to the 2nd floor outdoor living area<br>-Theater room with 85” HDTV and sound system<br>-3rd floor lounge area with multicade aracade game<br>-3rd floor coffee bar with beverage fridge<br>-4th-floor outdoor viewing deck with beautiful water and sunset views<br>-Kids space in bunk room<br>-All rooms with en-suite bathrooms with double vanities and king size beds (except bunks)<br>-EV charger<br>-4 Large Outdoor Living Areas:<br>-1st floor outdoor kitchen with built-in natural gas grill, dining table & fire pit<br>-2nd floor front balcony off king bedroom<br>-2nd floor back balcony with pool view, forest view, bar and porch swing bed<br>-3rd floor with pool view and forest view<br>-4th floor with ocean view<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (Sleeps 26):<br><br>FIRST FLOOR<br>-Guest Bedroom 1: King bed, en-suite bathroom with large glass shower<br><br>SECOND FLOOR<br>-Guest Bedroom 2: King bed, en-suite bathroom with large glass shower, private porch<br>-Guest Bedroom 3: King bed and built-in twin-over-twin bunk beds, en-suite bathroom with shower/tub combination<br>-Additional living area with game room<br>-Half bathroom<br><br>THIRD FLOOR<br>-Guest Bedroom 4: King bed, en-suite bathroom with large glass shower<br>-Guest Bedroom 5: King bed, en-suite bathroom with large glass shower and separate soaking tub<br>-Bunk Room 6: Built-in queen-over-queen bunk beds + built-in full-over-full bunk beds + 2 twin-over-twin bunk beds, and 1 full size bed, en-suite bathroom with 2 showers<br>-Additional living area with coffee bar/beverage fridge and wine bar<br><br>FOURTH FLOOR:<br>-Covered viewing deck with expansive Gulf views<br><br>Neighborhood Description<br><br>Seagrove's collection of lush oak trees, magnolias, and laid back, yet luxurious lifestyles makes it a favorite of longtime South Walton visitors. The landscape is complemented by its diverse mix of boutiques, casual cafes and an altogether upbeat ambiance.<br><br>A stay in Seagrove is full of adventure! The proximity demands that visitors explore Deer Lake State Park and Eastern Lake, and biking along the Timpoochee Trail in Seagrove is a preferred way to get around!<br><br>Just a stone's throw from the house is Café Thirty-A, a South Walton tradition. This favorite was one of the first to establish a foothold along Highway 30A. Not far to the west, on Highway 395, Seagrove Village Market is a must for succulent shrimp po-boys and good old nostalgia, having been part of the Seagrove community since 1949. Surfing Deer is also a guest favorite and walkable from the home - ask to sit on the patio!<br><br>The Old Florida Fish House is the perfect place for lunch or dinner. You don't want to miss out on their renowned sushi and live music! They also have a great outdoor space for kiddos and a wine bar/coffee shop next door! It is darling!!<br><br>The newly built Greenway Station is an easy bike ride away and has premium retail shopping and dining options, and The Big Chill 30A (formerly known as The Hub) is also just a quick ride away with lots of outdoor family fun including a large screen for watching sporting events and an open-air grassy area for kids to play!<br><br>With plenty of shady nooks, beautiful stretches of sun-soaked beach, and lots of fun to go around, Seagrove is the perfect beach community for families looking for a classic Florida vacation vibe - and this house emulates that feel at every turn!<br><br>You're just a 2-minute drive to Publix in WaterColor.<br><br>Other things to note<br>-Check in is 4:00 PM & check out is 10:00 AM. Late check out / early check in will be subject to another day's rental fees.<br>-Please note we provide a starter set of supplies such as toilet paper, paper towels, trash bags, dishwasher + laundry pods for your stay.<br>-Smoking is strictly prohibited.<br>-All renters must be over 25 years of age, or if under age 25 must be accompanied by a parent/legal guardian.<br>-LSV/golf cart is not to be driven past the town of WaterColor to the West or past The Big Chill to the East. Resolving any issue from the LSV/golf cart battery dying because of the renters not charging it will be charged to the renters.<br>-Pool and hot tub/spa heating must be for the full duration of your stay and must be requested 48 hours prior to check-in and paid before the heater will be turned on. Heating is available October 1st - April 30th, and the pool will be heated to 85 degrees. The cost of pool and hot tub/spa heating is $50 per day, except from December 1 - February 28, where the cost is $100 per day. After April 30, guests can still heat the hot tub/spa separately for the rate of $50 per day.<br>-Damage that occurs will be collected from the renters.<br>-Southern Holiday Homes can not be held liable for any damage or injury to any persons caused by LSV/golf cart, bikes, hot tub, pool, fire pit, or other amenities provided to guests.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "STUNNING! Loaded Home! Sleeps 26! LSV/Golf Cart & 6 Bikes! Resort-Style Pool, Steps to Beach!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
