            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your kind words and for sharing photos from your stay—it’s so nice to see your family enjoying the home! We’re glad you loved the living spaces, the golf cart, and the convenient location. We truly appreciate the recommendation and would love to welcome you back anytime!",
