        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Mar 15, 2025",
            "id": "29353d90-61e9-4e9c-984a-8bbc8a3c8987",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your heartfelt review! We’re absolutely thrilled to hear that your mother/son trip was such a special experience. \nIt’s truly touching to know that your Sunday morning devotional in the living room was a special moment for you both. We’re honored to have been a part of such a meaningful memory.\n\nWe’re also grateful for your kind words about our communication—we’re always here to help and are happy we could make your stay as seamless as possible. It was a pleasure hosting you, and we hope to welcome you back for more unforgettable memories at Pine & Palm!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We had the best time on our mother/son trip!!! The house is beautiful and was perfect for all of us. We really enjoyed the golf cart, bikes, bonfire, pool, hot tub, and game room. We cooked meals in the beautiful kitchen daily. It was a great location for us and an easy walk to the beach. We did a Sunday morning devotional in the living room and we will never forget that special time. The living room is so pretty and cozy. Thank you again for being so quick to answer our emails while we were there and resolving any issues quickly. We will never forget our SSFS trip and will treasure our memories always at Pine & Palm.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Mother son beach trip",
        "verified": true
      }
